<title>USA: Transamerican to buy some Sanifill assets.</title>
<headline>Transamerican to buy some Sanifill assets.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>TransAmerican Waste Industries Inc said on Wednesday it signed a definitive agreement to acquire certain assets of Sanifill Inc in the Houston area for $13.6 million in cash.</p>
<p>The U.S. Justice Department required USA Waste Services Inc divest these assets as part of its merger with Sanifill, TransAmerican said.</p>
